span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9817825481903fb0END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-6b7051d7e504d0baEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_AuntieEthelsRevenge_AdventureBook</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_AuntieEthelsRevenge_AdventureBook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_AuntieEthelsRevenge_AdventureBook\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">1cf7de46-086c-44a0-8a88-536ffa81e830</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1cf7de46-086c-44a0-8a88-536ffa81e830\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1cf7de46-086c-44a0-8a88-536ffa81e830\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Lora%27s_House\" title=\"Lora's House\">Lora's Home</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-64&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-91</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A collection of stories featuring legendary pirates of the Forgotten Realms. A note on the inside cover read, 'Lots of love, Uncle Tim Twofingers.']\n</p><p><br>\nGracie Gravehart drew her cutlass and pointed it at the evil Lord Buckler.\n</p><p><br>\n\"Your men are defeated. Your ships sunk. Free the people of Everwind, and I'll spare your pathetic life!\"\n</p><p><br>\nLord Buckler turned red with anger but knew he'd been beaten. And so he bowed his head, handing Gracie the key to the secret island of Everwind.\n</p><p><br>\nThe people cheered, crowning Gracie Queen! While Gracie continued to sail the Liberty with her daring crew, they made the hidden kingdom home. When Gracie died, her crew honoured her last wishes, burying their captain on the island, and tossing the key into Umberlee's embrace - so that none may torment Everwind the way the evil Lord Buckler once did.\n</p><p><br>\nWhile Gracie is long gone, they say you can still see the red sails of the Liberty on the horizon, right as the sun is about to rise.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/An_Overdue_Reunion\" title=\"An Overdue Reunion\">An Overdue Reunion</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203101\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1546/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31728/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11019/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930858/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.625      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.625      1 -total\n 59.97%   26.763      7 Template:Icon_text\n 54.04%   24.117     17 Template:Trim\n 35.78%   15.968      1 Template:PageSeo\n 35.63%   15.900      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 24.33%   10.858      2 Template:Icon_link\n 22.27%    9.936      2 Template:Uid\n 22.03%    9.830      1 Template:FRWiki\n 20.58%    9.182      7 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35119-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203101 and revision id 314028. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}